## 5) Monitoring Logs (How to View Logs Properly)

### ✅ Laravel log file

Default log location:

```
storage/logs/laravel.log
```

### ✅ Live log in terminal (Windows PowerShell)

```powershell
Get-Content .\storage\logs\laravel.log -Wait -Tail 100
```

### ✅ Live log in CMD

```bat
type .\storage\logs\laravel.log
```

### ✅ Clear logs (safe in dev)

Delete file:

```
storage/logs/laravel.log
```

Laravel will create again automatically.

