## 6) Improve Logging Channels (Daily rotation)

Edit `config/logging.php`:

Set default to daily:

```php
'default' => env('LOG_CHANNEL', 'daily'),
```

`.env`

```env
LOG_CHANNEL=daily
LOG_LEVEL=debug
```

Now logs rotate per day (better for real-world projects).

