## 7) Show Friendly Error Messages to Users (Flash)

When catching:

```php
try {
   // risky code
} catch (\Throwable $e) {
   Log::error('Failed action', ['error' => $e->getMessage()]);
   return back()->with('error', 'Something went wrong. Please try again.');
}
```

And in Blade:

```blade
@if(session('error'))
  <div class="alert danger">{{ session('error') }}</div>
@endif
```

